  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "According to the documentation, supplying purgeRelationship with an \"object\" of null should result in purging all relations which match ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://www.fedora-commons.org/documentation/3.0/userdocs/server/webservices/apim/index.html#methods.purgeRelationship"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://www.fedora-commons.org/documentation/3.0/userdocs/server/webservices/apim/index.html#methods.purgeRelationship",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "However, when I supply it with null, I get the following:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "INFO 2012-11-30 11:11:59.763 [ajp-bio-8009-exec-2] (DefaultManagement) Completed purgeRelationship(pid: uuid:4ecc25e9-cc02-4191-8589-ffbaecac258f, relationship: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://cdr.unc.edu/definitions/1.0/bas"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://cdr.unc.edu/definitions/1.0/bas",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "e-model.xml#isPublished, object: null, isLiteral: true, datatype: null)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "ERROR 2012-11-30 11:11:59.764 [ajp-bio-8009-exec-2] (FedoraAPIMBindingSOAPHTTPImpl) Error purging relationships",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "java.lang.IllegalArgumentException: Null \"newLexicalForm\" parameter",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.jrdf.graph.AbstractLiteral.<init>(AbstractLiteral.java:109) [mulgara-core-2.1.11.jar:na]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.fcrepo.common.rdf.SimpleLiteral.<init>(SimpleLiteral.java:22) [fcrepo-common-3.5.jar:na]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.fcrepo.server.storage.SimpleDOWriter.createTriple(SimpleDOWriter.java:484) [fcrepo-server-3.5.jar:na]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "...",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Setting object to not be a literal also fails, although slightly differently:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "INFO 2012-11-30 11:07:46.931 [ajp-bio-8009-exec-6] (DefaultManagement) Completed purgeRelationship(pid: uuid:4ecc25e9-cc02-4191-8589-ffbaecac258f, relationship: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://cdr.unc.edu/definitions/1.0/base-model.xml#isPublished,"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://cdr.unc.edu/definitions/1.0/base-model.xml#isPublished,",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " object: null, isLiteral: false, datatype: null)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "ERROR 2012-11-30 11:07:46.933 [ajp-bio-8009-exec-6] (FedoraAPIMBindingSOAPHTTPImpl) Error purging relationships",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "java.lang.NullPointerException: null",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at java.net.URI$Parser.parse(URI.java:3004) [na:1.6.0_37]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at java.net.URI.<init>(URI.java:577) [na:1.6.0_37]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.fcrepo.server.storage.SimpleDOWriter.createTriple(SimpleDOWriter.java:489) [fcrepo-server-3.5.jar:na]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.fcrepo.server.storage.SimpleDOWriter.purgeRelationship(SimpleDOWriter.java:406) [fcrepo-server-3.5.jar:na]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.fcrepo.server.storage.SimpleDOWriter.purgeRelationship(SimpleDOWriter.java:391) [fcrepo-server-3.5.jar:na]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.fcrepo.server.management.DefaultManagement.purgeRelationship(DefaultManagement.java:1755) [fcrepo-server-3.5.jar:na]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "...",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Looking at the source for SimpleDOWriter, there does not seem to be any case to check for the \"object\" being set to null, and AbstractLiteral doesn't seem to care for that:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/master/fcrepo-server/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/server/storage/SimpleDOWriter.java#L474"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/master/fcrepo-server/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/server/storage/SimpleDOWriter.java#L474",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The matching method, FilteredTripleIterator.matches(), also doesn't allow for a positive match when the searching for a null from what I can tell, so if it weren't excepting out earlier it would probably still not purge any relations:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/master/fcrepo-server/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/server/utilities/FilteredTripleIterator.java#L99"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/master/fcrepo-server/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/server/utilities/FilteredTripleIterator.java#L99",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Our setup is with an external mulgara triple store, running 3.6.1 at the moment",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
